From 3fe67d5b8f21860acfae92f441fcfb08374dbf01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ry <ry@local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:58:57 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] nebulos: convert android/phoenix to an Android library

phoenix becomes a com.android.library (AGP 9.2.1, composite-included by Nebulos as
com.retroarch:phoenix:embedded via includeBuild substitution): single variant instead of
product flavors, arm64-v8a only, Play Core stub, ndk-build of libretroarch-activity.so
unchanged. RetroActivityFuture is no longer final so NebulosRetroActivity can subclass it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pkg/android/phoenix/build.gradle              | 202 ++----------------
 pkg/android/phoenix/settings.gradle           |   2 +
 .../retroactivity/RetroActivityFuture.java    |   2 +-
 3 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 183 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pkg/android/phoenix/settings.gradle

